<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="so">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Somali Football Hub</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
    <!-- Icons FontAwesome -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Header / Navigation -->
    <header>
        <div class="top-bar">
            <span>Kubadda Cagta Soomaaliya! ⚽</span>
            <a href="#">Ka eeg Browser-ka</a>
        </div>
        <nav class="navbar">
            <div class="logo">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-futbol text-green"></i>
                <span>SOMALI <span class="text-green">FOOTBALL HUB</span></span>
            </div>
            <ul class="nav-links">
                <li><a href="#">Kulamada</a></li>
                <li><a href="#">Natiijooyinka</a></li>
                <li><a href="#">Kooroxaha</a></li>
                <li><a href="#">Wararka</a></li>
                <li><a href="#">Dalabyada</a></li>
            </ul>
            <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">Isoor Tikidhada</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <h1>U NOOLOW <br><span class="text-green">KUBADDA CAGTA</span></h1>
            <p>Xamaasada. Cayaaraha. Guusha. Kulanka kasta, daqiiqad kasta oo kubadda cagta Soomaaliyeed ah.</p>
            <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary"><i class="fa-solid fa-ticket"></i> HELLO TIKIDHADA KULANKA</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Match Spotlight -->
    <section class="container match-spotlight-section">
        <h2 class="section-title">KULANKA UGU WEYN</h2>
        <div class="spotlight-card">
            <div class="team">
                <div class="team-badge red">DEKEDDA</div>
                <h3>DEKEDDA FC</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="match-info">
                <div class="vs-badge">VS</div>
                <p class="match-time"><i class="fa-regular fa-calendar"></i> 26 MAAY 2026 &nbsp;|&nbsp; <i class="fa-regular fa-clock"></i> 04:00 PM</p>
                <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary"><i class="fa-solid fa-play"></i> DAAWO MOOGDGE (LIVE)</a>
            </div>
            <div class="team">
                <div class="team-badge blue">ELMAN</div>
                <h3>ELMAN FC</h3>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Upcoming Matches -->
    <section class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">KULAMADA SOO SOCDA</h2>
        <div class="matches-grid">
            
            <div class="match-card">
                <div class="teams-versus">
                    <span>HORSEED</span>
                    <span class="vs-sm">VS</span>
                    <span>MOGADISHU CITY</span>
                </div>
                <div class="match-details">
                    <p><i class="fa-regular fa-calendar"></i> 28 MAAY &nbsp; <i class="fa-regular fa-clock"></i> 03:30 PM</p>
                </div>
                <a href="#" class="link-btn">Faahfaahinta <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right"></i></a>
            </div>

            <div class="match-card">
                <div class="teams-versus">
                    <span>GAADIIDKA</span>
                    <span class="vs-sm">VS</span>
                    <span>HEEGAN</span>
                </div>
                <div class="match-details">
                    <p><i class="fa-regular fa-calendar"></i> 29 MAAY &nbsp; <i class="fa-regular fa-clock"></i> 04:00 PM</p>
                </div>
                <a href="#" class="link-btn">Faahfaahinta <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right"></i></a>
            </div>

            <div class="match-card">
                <div class="teams-versus">
                    <span>LFA PORT</span>
                    <span class="vs-sm">VS</span>
                    <span>BADBAADO</span>
                </div>
                <div class="match-details">
                    <p><i class="fa-regular fa-calendar"></i> 30 MAAY &nbsp; <i class="fa-regular fa-clock"></i> 03:45 PM</p>
                </div>
                <a href="#" class="link-btn">Faahfaahinta <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right"></i></a>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Latest News -->
    <section class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">WARARKII UGU DAMBEEYAY</h2>
        <div class="news-grid">
            <div class="main-news-card">
                <div class="news-img-placeholder">⚽ WARARKA KUBADDA CAGTA</div>
                <div class="news-content">
                    <h3>Finaalka Horyaalka Premier League Soomaaliya: Wax Kasta Oo Aad U Baahan Tahay In Aad Ogaato</h3>
                    <p>Eeg falanqaynta, xiddigaha muhiimka ah, iyo halka aad ka daawan karto ciyaarta ugu weyn xilli ciyaareedkan.</p>
                    <a href="#" class="link-btn text-green">Sii Akhri <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right"></i></a>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="side-news-card">
                <h4>WARAR KALE</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li><a href="#">10-kii Golaha Ugu Uzani Xilli Ciyaareedka <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right"></i></a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">Xaaladda Dhaawacyada Xiddigaha <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right"></i></a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">Wararkii Ugu Dambeeyay Ee Kala Iibsiga <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right"></i></a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">Falanqaynta Kulamada Horyaalka <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right"></i></a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Join Fan Zone Banner -->
    <section class="container">
        <div class="fan-zone-banner">
            <div class="fan-zone-info">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-trophy trophy-icon"></i>
                <div>
                    <h2>KUSOO BIIR FAN ZONE-KA!</h2>
                    <p>Hel wararkii ugu dambeeyay, qiimo dhimis tikidhada ah iyo fursado gaar ah.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <a href="#" class="btn btn-white">AHOO xubin (JOIN NOW)</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer>
        <div class="container footer-content">
            <div class="footer-about">
                <div class="logo">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-futbol text-green"></i>
                    <span>SOMALI <span class="text-green">FOOTBALL HUB</span></span>
                </div>
                <p>Goyntaada rasmiga ah ee natiijooyinka livenka ah, wararka, iyo wax kasta oo ku saabsan kubadda cagta Soomaaliya.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-links">
                <h4>XANNIYIHA</h4>
                <ul>
                    <li><a href="#">Kulamada</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">Kooroxaha</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">Wararka</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">Tikidhada</a></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-social">
                <h4>NA SOO RAAC</h4>
                <div class="social-icons">
                    <a href="#"><i class="fa-brands fa-facebook"></i></a>
                    <a href="#"><i class="fa-brands fa-twitter"></i></a>
                    <a href="#"><i class="fa-brands fa-instagram"></i></a>
                    <a href="#"><i class="fa-brands fa-youtube"></i></a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-bottom">
            <p>&copy; 2026 Somali Football Hub. Dhammaan xuquuqda waa la dhowray.</p>
        </div>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
